#: src/cli.rs:1067
msgid ""
"--game-path requires --game in non-interactive mode.\n"
"Pass --game sadx or --game sa2."
msgstr ""
"--game-path nécessite --game en mode non interactif.\n"
"Passez --game sadx ou --game sa2."

